xnu-12377 build fixes for project-BadApple's apollo files (1082-1186), one place for all of them.
- kmem_alloc, kmem_alloc_contig and the KMA_* flags are declared in <vm/vm_kern_xnu.h> on xnu-12377
  (build 44306947678: sweet_adsp.c, sweet_gpu.c, sweet_sound.c, sweet_wifi.c).
- processor_array is [MAX_CPUS] on xnu-12377 (MAX_SCHED_CPUS is gone): machine_routines.c (1153, 1180).
- bsd/kern/uipc_syscalls.c is built with -fbounds-safety: sweet_connect_said (1135) compares with memcmp and
  reads the address through a pointer bounded by sa_len (build 44312965616).

